由半角公式，

$$
\cos\alpha=1-2\sin^{2}\frac{\alpha}{2}
 =1-2\left(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{3}\right)^{2}
 =1-\frac{2}{3}=\frac{1}{3}
$$

故选 C.

